    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9193" root="حمل" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْمُولٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمِيلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also (tropical:)  A <i>fortunate</i>
man: from the riding of beasts such as are termed
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُرَّهٌ</span>, (K, * TA,) i. e. brisk, sharp, and strong.
(TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فره</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [In logic, (assumed tropical:)  <i>A predicate:</i>
and (assumed tropical:)  <i>an accident:</i> in each of these senses <i>contr.
of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْضُوعٌ</span>.]

